<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ubuntu on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/categories/ubuntu/</link><description>Recent content in Ubuntu on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-tw</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2020 13:00:05 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/categories/ubuntu/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Ubuntu 18.04 透過 netplan 設定網路卡 IP</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2020/20200918-ubuntu-18-04/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2020 13:00:05 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2020/20200918-ubuntu-18-04/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.toright.com/posts/6293/ubuntu-18-04-%E9%80%8F%E9%81%8E-netplan-%E8%A8%AD%E5%AE%9A%E7%B6%B2%E8%B7%AF%E5%8D%A1-ip.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Ubuntu 18.04 透過 netplan 設定網路卡 IP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;照上面的說明看了一下 /etc/netplan 目錄，查閱一下 /etc/netplan/50-cloud-init.yaml，如下：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-7967adef555b99a03649b957bc5ea1e1-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# This file is generated from information provided by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# the datasource. Changes to it will not persist across an instance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# To disable cloud-init&amp;#39;s network configuration capabilities, write a file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# /etc/cloud/cloud.cfg.d/99-disable-network-config.cfg with the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# network: {config: disabled}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ethernets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ens192&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;dhcp4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;ens224&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;dhcp4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;version&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="m"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"# This file is generated from information provided by\n# the datasource. Changes to it will not persist across an instance.\n# To disable cloud-init's network configuration capabilities, write a file\n# /etc/cloud/cloud.cfg.d/99-disable-network-config.cfg with the following:\n# network: {config: disabled}\nnetwork:\n ethernets:\n ens192:\n dhcp4: true\n ens224:\n dhcp4: true\n version: 2\n","title":"yaml"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;看來可以關閉 cloud network，但是我其實也沒有要用 cloud-init，乾脆移除它，如下：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>